# Salvation Engine (6/10 Vehicle, Crew 6): "Other artifact creatures you control get +2/+2." "Whenever this Vehicle attacks, return up
# to one target artifact card from your graveyard to the battlefield." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with five Moxes and a free
# Ornithopter, which survives one Bolt (a 2/4 with the bonus) and dies to a second on turn 2. On turn 3 a summoning-sick Adaptive Snapjaw (power 6) crews it (CR 702.122a), and
# when the Engine attacks Bot1 targets the Ornithopter in the graveyard: it returns as an artifact creature, a 2/4 with the
# Engine's bonus (a 0/2 printed). The Engine itself is no "other" and stays 6/10; the non-artifact Snapjaw is not boosted (its 7/3 is
# its Evolve counter, as the 2/4 Ornithopter entering has greater toughness than 6/2).

